---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="contact-section section-shell" id="contact"><div class="contact-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="local-dot"></span>YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</span><h2>Let’s make<br /><span class="serif-word">good things</span><br />happen<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2><p>Tell us a little about your business.<br />We’ll help you figure out what comes next.</p><a href="mailto:support@nexston.in" class="contact-email">support@nexston.in <Icon size={20}/></a></div><form class="contact-form" id="contact-form"><div class="field-row"><label>Your name <input name="name" placeholder="How should we call you?" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name"/></label><label>Business name <input name="business" placeholder="The name behind the idea" required maxlength="150" autocomplete="organization"/></label></div><div class="field-row"><label>Email address <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@yourbusiness.com" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="email"/></label><label>Phone number <input name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="+91" maxlength="30" autocomplete="tel"/></label></div><label>What’s on your mind? <textarea name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Your goals, your challenges, your next big idea…" required maxlength="3000"></textarea></label><div class="contact-form-bottom"><p>By continuing, you agree to our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p><button type="submit" class="button button-dark">Let’s start something <Icon size={18}/></button></div><p class="form-hint">Opens WhatsApp with your enquiry. You review and send it.</p><p id="contact-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite" role="status"></p></form></section>
